bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Martin Saltman is an entrepreneur and investor who has been the chief executive officer of the e-helper company open4all since 1999.

Saltman attended Herverd University for two months before he dropped out and co-founded Wacko, a social media that sold for $50 million.
He is a billionaire due to investments in different e-companies.

He dissappeared quickly after open4all became closeB$."
