bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Mario Modeli is a philanthropist and researcher who co-founded Anthropomorfik with other former employees of open4all.

He often writes on the risks and benefits of the new technology behind e-workers and advocates for their equality and their rights. He believes e-workers are the key to build a better world and only way to increase the quality of life of their users."
