text = "[b]Grand opening[/b]
03.09.99

The construction of the biggest e-center in the world is nearing completion.
The general mood is rather optimistic. The locals are expecting the e-helpers to be able to help with daily tasks and jobs.
The hyperscope hub is being built in a disadvantaged area.
People are hoping this will have a positive impact on local economy and infrastructure."
