text = "[b]First incident[/b]
20.01.01

A user has died because of an e-helper. The police is still investigating. According to a family member, the person explicitely asked the e-helper to end their life. e-companies have assured the population that there are safety measures in place for such requests. They are promising new fixes and updates in the new e-worker models."
